            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery spasm induced by 5-fluorouracil.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>468-70</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of coronary artery spasm induced by 5-fluorouracil. The symptoms occurred during continuous intravenous infusion of the drug, and a coronary spasm was visualized at angiography.</AbstractText>
